# Global contact plan for QoS best-effort TCP fallback test
# Topology: Node 1 --LTP--> Node 2 --TCP--> Node 3
m horizon +0

# Ranges (one-way light time in seconds)
a range +0 +3600 1 2 1
a range +0 +3600 2 1 1
a range +0 +3600 2 3 1
a range +0 +3600 3 2 1
a range +0 +3600 1 3 2

# Contacts (capacity in bytes/sec)
a contact +0 +3600 1 1 100000
a contact +0 +3600 2 2 100000
a contact +0 +3600 3 3 100000
a contact +0 +3600 1 2 100000
a contact +0 +3600 2 1 100000
a contact +0 +3600 2 3 100000
a contact +0 +3600 3 2 100000
